<tbx type="TBX-Basic" style="dca" xml:lang="en" xmlns="urn:iso:std:iso:30042:ed-2">
<tbxHeader><fileDesc><sourceDesc><p>Diffusion Works — Semiconductor Equipment Termbase — evaluation sample (50 terms). Non-commercial evaluation use only.</p></sourceDesc></fileDesc></tbxHeader>
<text><body>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-02098"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / mechanical-motion</descrip><descrip type="definition">A bearing in which a thin film of pressurized air separates the moving element from its guide surface, giving frictionless, wear-free motion with very low vibration. Wafer and reticle stages and precision spindles use it, often with vacuum preload, where mechanical bearings would add friction, particles or hysteresis.</descrip><admin type="source">A. H. Slocum, Precision Machine Design (Prentice Hall, 1992)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>air bearing</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>aerostatic bearing</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>gas bearing</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>エアベアリング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>空気軸受</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>静圧空気軸受</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>エア軸受</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>エアーベアリング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>空気ベアリング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「空気ベアリング」は和洋混合で現場では使わない（エアベアリング／空気軸受）。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>气浮轴承</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>空气轴承</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>气体静压轴承</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>空气承载</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「空気ベアリング」は和洋混合で現場では使わない（エアベアリング／空気軸受）。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>에어 베어링</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>공기 베어링</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>공기 정압 베어링</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>공기 지지대</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「空気ベアリング」は和洋混合で現場では使わない（エアベアリング／空気軸受）。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Luftlager</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>aerostatisches Lager</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Luftlagerung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Gaslager</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>cojinete de aire</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>cojinete aerostático</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>cojinete neumático</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>air bearing</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-01164"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / deposition</descrip><descrip type="definition">A thin-film deposition method in which two or more precursor gases are pulsed alternately into the chamber, each reacting with the surface in a self-limiting way so that film grows roughly one atomic layer per cycle. It gives precise thickness control and conformal coverage in high-aspect-ratio structures.</descrip><admin type="source">S. M. George, Atomic Layer Deposition: An Overview, Chem. Rev. 110, 111 (2010); SEMI International Standards: Compilation of Terms</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>atomic layer deposition</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ALD</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>atomic layer epitaxy</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>原子層堆積</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ALD</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ALD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>原子層成膜</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>アトミックレイヤーデポジション</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>原子層沈着</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>deposition を「沈着」「付着」「침전」「Ablagerung」「sedimentación」（沈殿・堆積物）と訳すのは誤り。中「蒸镀」は蒸発法（PVD）の語で ALD には不適。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec><termSec><term>原子層付着</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>deposition を「沈着」「付着」「침전」「Ablagerung」「sedimentación」（沈殿・堆積物）と訳すのは誤り。中「蒸镀」は蒸発法（PVD）の語で ALD には不適。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>原子层沉积</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ALD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>原子层淀积</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>原子层蒸镀</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>deposition を「沈着」「付着」「침전」「Ablagerung」「sedimentación」（沈殿・堆積物）と訳すのは誤り。中「蒸镀」は蒸発法（PVD）の語で ALD には不適。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>원자층 증착</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ALD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>원자층 침전</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>deposition を「沈着」「付着」「침전」「Ablagerung」「sedimentación」（沈殿・堆積物）と訳すのは誤り。中「蒸镀」は蒸発法（PVD）の語で ALD には不適。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Atomlagenabscheidung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ALD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Atomic Layer Deposition</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Atomschichtablagerung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>deposition を「沈着」「付着」「침전」「Ablagerung」「sedimentación」（沈殿・堆積物）と訳すのは誤り。中「蒸镀」は蒸発法（PVD）の語で ALD には不適。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>deposición de capas atómicas</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ALD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>depósito por capas atómicas</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>sedimentación de capas atómicas</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>deposition を「沈着」「付着」「침전」「Ablagerung」「sedimentación」（沈殿・堆積物）と訳すのは誤り。中「蒸镀」は蒸発法（PVD）の語で ALD には不適。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-00024"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / automation-factory</descrip><descrip type="definition">The fab-wide system of overhead transport vehicles, stockers, conveyors and control software that moves wafer carriers between tools and storage without manual handling. It covers both interbay and intrabay transport.</descrip><admin type="source">SEMI E153 — Specification for AMHS SEM (AMHS SEM)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>automated material handling system</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>AMHS</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>automated material handling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>自動搬送システム</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>AMHS</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>AMHS</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>自動マテリアルハンドリングシステム</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>自動材料処理システム</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「材料処理／材料处理」は material handling の直訳で、化学処理と誤解される。現場では「搬送」で通じる。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>自動材料取扱システム</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「材料処理／材料处理」は material handling の直訳で、化学処理と誤解される。現場では「搬送」で通じる。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>自动物料搬运系统</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>自动物料传送系统</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>AMHS</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>自动材料处理系统</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「材料処理／材料处理」は material handling の直訳で、化学処理と誤解される。現場では「搬送」で通じる。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>자동 반송 시스템</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>AMHS</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>자동 물류 시스템</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>automatisiertes Materialtransportsystem</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>AMHS</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>automatisches Transportsystem</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>sistema automatizado de manejo de materiales</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>AMHS</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>sistema de transporte automatizado de materiales</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-01710"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / implant</descrip><descrip type="definition">Measuring the ion beam current, usually with a Faraday cup in the beamline or end station, to integrate charge and control implanted dose. Secondary-electron suppression and neutral-beam compensation are needed so that the reading equals the true ion current reaching the wafer.</descrip><admin type="source">S. Wolf and R. N. Tauber, Silicon Processing for the VLSI Era, Vol. 1: Process Technology, 2nd ed., Lattice Press (2000)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>beam current measurement</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>beam current monitoring</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Faraday measurement</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ビーム電流測定</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ビーム電流計測</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ビームカレント測定</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ビーム電流モニタ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>光線電流測定</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>beam を「光線」「光束」「광선」と訳すのは光学の誤訳。イオン注入では「ビーム電流／束流」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>束流测量</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>束流电流测量</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>离子束电流测量</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>光束电流测量</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>beam を「光線」「光束」「광선」と訳すのは光学の誤訳。イオン注入では「ビーム電流／束流」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>빔 전류 측정</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>빔 커런트 측정</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>이온빔 전류 측정</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>광선 전류 측정</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>beam を「光線」「光束」「광선」と訳すのは光学の誤訳。イオン注入では「ビーム電流／束流」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Strahlstrommessung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Ionenstrahlstrommessung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>medición de la corriente del haz</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>medida de corriente de haz</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>medición de corriente del haz iónico</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-01695"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / implant</descrip><descrip type="definition">Penetration of implanted ions far deeper than expected when the beam is aligned with a low-index crystal direction and ions travel between atomic rows with few collisions. Implanters tilt and twist the wafer, or use a screen oxide, to randomize incidence and keep the junction depth predictable.</descrip><admin type="source">S. Wolf and R. N. Tauber, Silicon Processing for the VLSI Era, Vol. 1: Process Technology, 2nd ed., Lattice Press (2000)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>channeling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ion channeling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>channelling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>チャネリング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>チャンネリング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>イオンチャネリング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>溝加工</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溝加工」「水路化」「Kanalisierung」は機械加工・土木の channeling。注入では結晶軸に沿う深い侵入現象を指す。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>水路化</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溝加工」「水路化」「Kanalisierung」は機械加工・土木の channeling。注入では結晶軸に沿う深い侵入現象を指す。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>経路形成</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溝加工」「水路化」「Kanalisierung」は機械加工・土木の channeling。注入では結晶軸に沿う深い侵入現象を指す。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>沟道效应</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>离子沟道效应</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>通道效应</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>槽道化</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溝加工」「水路化」「Kanalisierung」は機械加工・土木の channeling。注入では結晶軸に沿う深い侵入現象を指す。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>沟槽加工</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溝加工」「水路化」「Kanalisierung」は機械加工・土木の channeling。注入では結晶軸に沿う深い侵入現象を指す。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>채널링</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>채널링 효과</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>이온 채널링</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>채널 가공</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溝加工」「水路化」「Kanalisierung」は機械加工・土木の channeling。注入では結晶軸に沿う深い侵入現象を指す。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Channeling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Channeling-Effekt</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Gitterführungseffekt</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Kanalisierung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溝加工」「水路化」「Kanalisierung」は機械加工・土木の channeling。注入では結晶軸に沿う深い侵入現象を指す。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>canalización</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>channeling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>efecto de canalización</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>canalización iónica</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-01185"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / deposition</descrip><descrip type="definition">Growth of a solid film on a heated substrate from gaseous precursors that react or decompose at or near the surface, with by-products carried away by the exhaust. Thermal, plasma-enhanced and low-pressure variants are used for dielectrics, polysilicon and metals.</descrip><admin type="source">SEMI M59 — Terminology for Silicon Technology; H. O. Pierson, Handbook of Chemical Vapor Deposition, 2nd ed. (Noyes, 1999)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>chemical vapor deposition</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>CVD</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>chemical vapour deposition</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>化学気相成長</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>CVD</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>CVD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>化学蒸着</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>化学気相堆積</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>化学的気相成長</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>化学蒸気堆積</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>vapor を水蒸気の「蒸気」「蒸汽」「증기」と訳すと誤り。気相(gas phase)からの成膜。「析出」「Ablagerung」「침전」は沈殿・堆積物の意。西 vapor químico は語順で意味が変わる。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec><termSec><term>化学的蒸気析出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>vapor を水蒸気の「蒸気」「蒸汽」「증기」と訳すと誤り。気相(gas phase)からの成膜。「析出」「Ablagerung」「침전」は沈殿・堆積物の意。西 vapor químico は語順で意味が変わる。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>化学气相沉积</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>CVD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>化学气相淀积</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>化学蒸汽沉积</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>vapor を水蒸気の「蒸気」「蒸汽」「증기」と訳すと誤り。気相(gas phase)からの成膜。「析出」「Ablagerung」「침전」は沈殿・堆積物の意。西 vapor químico は語順で意味が変わる。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>화학 기상 증착</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>CVD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>화학적 기상 증착</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>화학 증기 침전</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>vapor を水蒸気の「蒸気」「蒸汽」「증기」と訳すと誤り。気相(gas phase)からの成膜。「析出」「Ablagerung」「침전」は沈殿・堆積物の意。西 vapor químico は語順で意味が変わる。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>chemische Gasphasenabscheidung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>CVD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Chemical Vapour Deposition</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>chemische Dampfablagerung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>vapor を水蒸気の「蒸気」「蒸汽」「증기」と訳すと誤り。気相(gas phase)からの成膜。「析出」「Ablagerung」「침전」は沈殿・堆積物の意。西 vapor químico は語順で意味が変わる。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>deposición química de vapor</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>CVD</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>deposición química en fase vapor</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>depósito químico en fase vapor</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>deposición de vapor químico</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>vapor を水蒸気の「蒸気」「蒸汽」「증기」と訳すと誤り。気相(gas phase)からの成膜。「析出」「Ablagerung」「침전」は沈殿・堆積物の意。西 vapor químico は語順で意味が変わる。確認した公開資料に用例なし（辞書訳）。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-00773"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / cleaning</descrip><descrip type="definition">The angle between the surface of a liquid droplet and the solid surface it rests on, measured through the liquid. On wafers it quantifies how hydrophilic or hydrophobic a surface is after cleaning and predicts watermark and drying behavior.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 19403-2 — Paints and varnishes — Wettability — Part 2: Determination of the surface free energy of solid surfaces by measuring the contact angle; K. A. Reinhardt &amp; W. Kern (eds.), Handbook of Silicon Wafer Cleaning Technology, 3rd ed. (William Andrew, 2018)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>contact angle</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>wetting angle</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>water contact angle</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>接触角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>濡れ角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>水接触角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>コンタクトアングル</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>接点角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「触角」は昆虫の触角、「接点角」は電気接点を連想させる誤訳。独は Kontaktwinkel と Randwinkel が併存。 確認した。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>触角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「触角」は昆虫の触角、「接点角」は電気接点を連想させる誤訳。独は Kontaktwinkel と Randwinkel が併存。 確認した。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>接触角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>润湿角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>水接触角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>触角</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「触角」は昆虫の触角、「接点角」は電気接点を連想させる誤訳。独は Kontaktwinkel と Randwinkel が併存。 確認した。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>접촉각</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>젖음각</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>물 접촉각</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>접점각</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「触角」は昆虫の触角、「接点角」は電気接点を連想させる誤訳。独は Kontaktwinkel と Randwinkel が併存。 確認した。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Kontaktwinkel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Randwinkel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Benetzungswinkel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Berührungswinkel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「触角」は昆虫の触角、「接点角」は電気接点を連想させる誤訳。独は Kontaktwinkel と Randwinkel が併存。 確認した。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>ángulo de contacto</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ángulo de mojado</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ángulo de humectación</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-00738"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / cleaning</descrip><descrip type="definition">Unintended transfer of chemical species, particles or metallic impurities from one wafer, bath or chamber to another, for example when wafers from different process steps share a cleaning bath. Tool dedication and recipe segregation are used to prevent it.</descrip><admin type="source">W. Kern (ed.), Handbook of Semiconductor Wafer Cleaning Technology (Noyes, 1993); K. A. Reinhardt &amp; W. Kern (eds.), Handbook of Silicon Wafer Cleaning Technology, 3rd ed. (William Andrew, 2018)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>cross-contamination</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>cross contamination</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>クロスコンタミネーション</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>クロスコンタミ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>相互汚染</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>交差汚染</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>二次汚染</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「二次汚染」は別概念で用例なし。独「Überkreuzverschmutzung」は直訳で用例なし。「交差汚染」はJIS Z 8122に用例があり別表記に含める。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>交叉污染</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>交叉沾污</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>교차 오염</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>크로스 컨타미네이션</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>크로스 컨탐</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Kreuzkontamination</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Querkontamination</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Überkreuzverschmutzung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「二次汚染」は別概念で用例なし。独「Überkreuzverschmutzung」は直訳で用例なし。「交差汚染」はJIS Z 8122に用例があり別表記に含める。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>contaminación cruzada</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-02968"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / wafer-substrate</descrip><descrip type="definition">The crystallographic direction of a single-crystal wafer surface normal, such as (100) or (111), together with the azimuthal reference given by the notch or flat. It determines etch behaviour, oxidation rate, carrier mobility and cleavage, and is checked by X-ray or optical methods.</descrip><admin type="source">SEMI MF26 — Test Method for Determining the Orientation of a Semiconductive Single Crystal</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>crystal orientation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>wafer orientation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>crystallographic orientation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>surface orientation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>結晶方位</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>面方位</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>結晶面方位</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>結晶軸方位</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ウェハ方位</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>結晶配向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>crystal を「水晶/수정/Quarz/cuarzo」（石英）と訳す機械翻訳誤りが典型。JA「結晶配向」は多結晶膜の配向（テクスチャ）の語で単結晶ウェーハの方位には使わない。その他のNGは公開資料（JIS・SEAJ用語集・メーカー資料）に用例のない辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>結晶の向き</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>crystal を「水晶/수정/Quarz/cuarzo」（石英）と訳す機械翻訳誤りが典型。JA「結晶配向」は多結晶膜の配向（テクスチャ）の語で単結晶ウェーハの方位には使わない。その他のNGは公開資料（JIS・SEAJ用語集・メーカー資料）に用例のない辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>水晶方位</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>crystal を「水晶/수정/Quarz/cuarzo」（石英）と訳す機械翻訳誤りが典型。JA「結晶配向」は多結晶膜の配向（テクスチャ）の語で単結晶ウェーハの方位には使わない。その他のNGは公開資料（JIS・SEAJ用語集・メーカー資料）に用例のない辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>晶向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>晶体取向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>晶面取向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>晶体方向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>晶体定向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>水晶方向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>crystal を「水晶/수정/Quarz/cuarzo」（石英）と訳す機械翻訳誤りが典型。JA「結晶配向」は多結晶膜の配向（テクスチャ）の語で単結晶ウェーハの方位には使わない。その他のNGは公開資料（JIS・SEAJ用語集・メーカー資料）に用例のない辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>晶体朝向</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>crystal を「水晶/수정/Quarz/cuarzo」（石英）と訳す機械翻訳誤りが典型。JA「結晶配向」は多結晶膜の配向（テクスチャ）の語で単結晶ウェーハの方位には使わない。その他のNGは公開資料（JIS・SEAJ用語集・メーカー資料）に用例のない辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>结晶方位</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>crystal を「水晶/수정/Quarz/cuarzo」（石英）と訳す機械翻訳誤りが典型。JA「結晶配向」は多結晶膜の配向（テクスチャ）の語で単結晶ウェーハの方位には使わない。その他のNGは公開資料（JIS・SEAJ用語集・メーカー資料）に用例のない辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>결정 방향</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>결정 방위</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>결정면 방위</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admitt