<conceptEntry id="SEMI-02454"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / quality-reliability</descrip><descrip type="definition">Measurement of electrical parameters on test structures or devices on a wafer to confirm that the process has produced the intended transistor and interconnect characteristics. In a fab it is run on wafers at defined points of the flow, often at the end, to accept or reject lots.</descrip><admin type="source">G. S. May &amp; C. J. Spanos, Fundamentals of Semiconductor Manufacturing and Process Control (Wiley, 2006)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>electrical test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>e-test</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>E-test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>parametric test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>wafer electrical test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>電気特性試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>電気テスト</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>E-test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>電気特性評価</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>電気特性検査</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ウェハ電気試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>耐電圧試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「耐電圧試験/電気安全試験」（各言語の同義語を含む）は装置や製品の安全規格試験で、ウェハの電気特性評価とは別概念。power を電力と誤読した「電力試験/电力测试/전력 테스트/Stromtest/prueba de potencia」も不可。</note></termSec><termSec><term>電気安全試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「耐電圧試験/電気安全試験」（各言語の同義語を含む）は装置や製品の安全規格試験で、ウェハの電気特性評価とは別概念。power を電力と誤読した「電力試験/电力测试/전력 테스트/Stromtest/prueba de potencia」も不可。</note></termSec><termSec><term>電力試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「耐電圧試験/電気安全試験」（各言語の同義語を含む）は装置や製品の安全規格試験で、ウェハの電気特性評価とは別概念。power を電力と誤読した「電力試験/电力测试/전력 테스트/Stromtest/prueba de potencia」も不可。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>电性测试</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>电学测试</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>电参数测试</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>电性能测试</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>WAT测试</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>电力测试</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「耐電圧試験/電気安全試験」（各言語の同義語を含む）は装置や製品の安全規格試験で、ウェハの電気特性評価とは別概念。power を電力と誤読した「電力試験/电力测试/전력 테스트/Stromtest/prueba de potencia」も不可。</note></termSec><termSec><term>电气安全测试</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「耐電圧試験/電気安全試験」（各言語の同義語を含む）は装置や製品の安全規格試験で、ウェハの電気特性評価とは別概念。power を電力と誤読した「電力試験/电力测试/전력 테스트/Stromtest/prueba de potencia」も不可。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>전기 특성 테스트</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>전기적 테스트</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>E-test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn