e></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>prueba eléctrica</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>test eléctrico</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ensayo eléctrico</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>prueba de parámetros eléctricos</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>E-test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>prueba de potencia</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「耐電圧試験/電気安全試験」（各言語の同義語を含む）は装置や製品の安全規格試験で、ウェハの電気特性評価とは別概念。power を電力と誤読した「電力試験/电力测试/전력 테스트/Stromtest/prueba de potencia」も不可。</note></termSec><termSec><term>prueba de seguridad eléctrica</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「耐電圧試験/電気安全試験」（各言語の同義語を含む）は装置や製品の安全規格試験で、ウェハの電気特性評価とは別概念。power を電力と誤読した「電力試験/电力测试/전력 테스트/Stromtest/prueba de potencia」も不可。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-00014"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / automation-factory</descrip><descrip type="definition">A hard-wired button and circuit that removes hazardous power from a tool at once, independently of the control software. It is the last-resort cut-off defined for cluster tools and fab equipment, distinct from a controlled emergency stop.</descrip><admin type="source">SEMI E20 — Cluster Tool Module Interface: Electrical Power and Emergency Off Standard; SEMI S2 — Environmental, Health, and Safety Guideline for Semiconductor Manufacturing Equipment</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>emergency off</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>EMO</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>emergency off circuit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>EMO circuit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>EMO</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>緊急遮断</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>EMO回路</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>EMOボタン</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>非常遮断</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>非常停止</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「非常停止／紧急停止／비상정지／Not-Halt／parada de emergencia」は制御系で機械を止める emergency stop（E-stop）を指し、電源を遮断する EMO（emergency switching off）とは SEMI S2・IEC 60204-1（JIS B 9960-1）で区別される。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>紧急关断</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>紧急断电</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>EMO</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>紧急停止</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「非常停止／紧急停止／비상정지／Not-Halt／parada de emergencia」は制御系で機械を止める emergency stop（E-stop）を指し、電源を遮断する EMO（emergency switching off）とは SEMI S2・IEC 60204-1（JIS B 9960-1）で区別される。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>EMO</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>비상 전원 차단</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>이엠오</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>비상정지</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「非常停止／紧急停止／비상정지／Not-Halt／parada de emergencia」は制御系で機械を止める emergency stop（E-stop）を指し、電源を遮断する EMO（emergency switching off）とは SEMI S2・IEC 60204-1（JIS B 9960-1）で区別される。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Not-Aus</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>EMO</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Not-Aus-Schaltung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Ausschalten im Notfall</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Not-Halt</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「非常停止／紧急停止／비상정지／Not-Halt／parada de emergencia」は制御系で機械を止める emergency stop（E-stop）を指し、電源を遮断する EMO（emergency switching off）とは SEMI S2・IEC 60204-1（JIS B 9960-1）で区別される。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>desconexión de emergencia</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>EMO</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>corte de emergencia</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>parada de emergencia</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「非常停止／紧急停止／비상정지／Not-Halt／parada de emergencia」は制御系で機械を止める emergency stop（E-stop）を指し、電源を遮断する EMO（emergency switching off）とは SEMI S2・IEC 60204-1（JIS B 9960-1）で区別される。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-01680"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / implant</descrip><descrip type="definition">Drawing ions out of the ion source plasma through a slit and forming them into a beam with electrodes held at high potential relative to the source. The extraction voltage and electrode geometry set the initial beam energy and the current an implanter can deliver.</descrip><admin type="source">S. Wolf and R. N. Tauber, Silicon Processing for the VLSI Era, Vol. 1: Process Technology, 2nd ed., Lattice Press (2000); J. F. Ziegler (ed.), Ion Implantation: Science and Technology, 2nd ed., Academic Press (1988)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>extraction</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ion extraction</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>beam extraction</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>extraction from the ion source</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>引き出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>イオン引き出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ビーム引き出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>引出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>取り出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>抽出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「抽出」「摘出」「提取」「抽取」は化学分離・データ抽出・外科摘出の語。イオン源からは「引き出す」（引出電極）が慣用。</note></termSec><termSec><term>摘出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「抽出」「摘出」「提取」「抽取」は化学分離・データ抽出・外科摘出の語。イオン源からは「引き出す」（引出電極）が慣用。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>引出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>离子引出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>束流引出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>提取</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「抽出」「摘出」「提取」「抽取」は化学分離・データ抽出・外科摘出の語。イオン源からは「引き出す」（引出電極）が慣用。</note></termSec><termSec><term>抽取</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「抽出」「摘出」「提取」「抽取」は化学分離・データ抽出・外科摘出の語。イオン源からは「引き出す」（引出電極）が慣用。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>인출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>이온 인출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>빔 인출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>익스트랙션</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>추출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Extraktion</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Ionenextraktion</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Strahlextraktion</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>extracción</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>extracción de iones</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>extracción del haz</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-01544"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / gas-chemical</descrip><descrip type="definition">Continuous sensing of hazardous gas concentration at points such as gas cabinets, valve manifold boxes and tool enclosures, with alarms and interlocks that cut off supply when a leak is found. It is a core requirement of equipment safety design for toxic, flammable and corrosive gases.</descrip><admin type="source">SEMI S2 — Environmental, Health, and Safety Guideline for Semiconductor Manufacturing Equipment</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>gas detection</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>gas leak detection</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>gas sensing</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ガス検知</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ガス検出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ガスモニタリング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>漏洩ガス検知</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ガス探査</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「探査」「発見」「发现」は detection の一般訳。安全設備では「ガス検知（器）」「气体检测」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>ガス発見</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「探査」「発見」「发现」は detection の一般訳。安全設備では「ガス検知（器）」「气体检测」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>气体检测</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>气体探测</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>气体泄漏检测</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>气体监测</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>气体发现</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「探査」「発見」「发现」は detection の一般訳。安全設備では「ガス検知（器）」「气体检测」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>가스 감지</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>가스 검지</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>가스 누출 감지</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>가스 검출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Gasdetektion</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Gaswarnung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Gasüberwachung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Gasmeldung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>detección de gases</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>detección de fugas de gas</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>monitoreo de gases</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-01557"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / gas-chemical</descrip><descrip type="definition">A liquid chemical refined to semiconductor-grade limits on metallic, particulate and anionic contamination, used for wafer cleaning, etching and resist processing. Its purity grade sets the materials and cleanliness required of the delivery and dispense system.</descrip><admin type="source">SEMI C1 — Guide for the Analysis of Liquid Chemicals; SEMI F57 — Specification for High Purity Polymer Materials and Components Used in Ultrapure Water and Liquid Chemical Distribution Systems</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>high-purity chemical</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ultra-high-purity chemical</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>electronic-grade chemical</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>高純度薬品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高純度化学薬品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高純度ケミカル</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>電子工業用薬品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高純度化学物質</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「化学物質」は化審法など法令の語、「薬剤」は医薬のニュアンス。半導体では「薬品／ケミカル」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>高純度薬剤</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「化学物質」は化審法など法令の語、「薬剤」は医薬のニュアンス。半導体では「薬品／ケミカル」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>高纯化学品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高纯试剂</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>电子级化学品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>湿电子化学品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高纯化学物质</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「化学物質」は化審法など法令の語、「薬剤」は医薬のニュアンス。半導体では「薬品／ケミカル」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>고순도 화학약품</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>고순도 케미컬</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>전자급 화학약품</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>hochreine Chemikalie</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Hochreinchemikalie</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Elektronikchemikalie</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>químico de alta pureza</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>producto químico de alta pureza</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>químico grado electrónico</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="SEMI-02536"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / test</descrip><descrip type="definition">A reliability stress test in which packaged devices are operated under bias at elevated ambient temperature for an extended time, typically 1000 hours, to accelerate wear-out and infant mortality failure mechanisms. Results are used to project field lifetime.</descrip><admin type="source">JEDEC JESD22-A108 — Temperature, Bias, and Operating Life</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>high-temperature operating life</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>HTOL</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>HTOL test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>high temperature operating life test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>operating life test</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>高温動作寿命試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>HTOL試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高温動作試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高温動作寿命</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高温通電寿命試験</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高温運転寿命</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>life を「生活/Leben」、operating を「運転/操作（日・韓）/経営/Operation」と訳すのは機械翻訳の典型誤り。信頼性分野の定訳は「動作寿命（工作寿命）」。中国語の「高温操作寿命」は台湾の定着表記のため異表記扱い。見出し語自体の用例が未確認のためNG訳も据え置き（公開資料に用例なし）</note></termSec><