<conceptEntry id="SEMI-02111"><descrip type="subjectField">semi / mechanical-motion</descrip><descrip type="definition">The maximum deviation between the commanded and the actually reached position of a motion axis over its travel, normally stated together with repeatability. Equipment specifications quote it for stages, robots and aligners to show how closely a target coordinate can be hit.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 230-2 — Test code for machine tools — Part 2: Determination of accuracy and repeatability of positioning of numerically controlled axes</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>positioning accuracy</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>accuracy of positioning</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>absolute positioning accuracy</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>位置決め精度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>位置決め確度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>位置精度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>配置精度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「配置精度」「放置精度」「배치 정밀도」「Platzierung」「colocación」は部品配置（placement）の語。軸の位置決めは「位置決め精度」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec><termSec><term>ポジショニング正確さ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「配置精度」「放置精度」「배치 정밀도」「Platzierung」「colocación」は部品配置（placement）の語。軸の位置決めは「位置決め精度」。 上記の NG訳は公開資料に用例がない直訳・辞書訳。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>定位精度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>定位准确度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admit